                             (default: false)                                   
                                                                                
                             EXAMPLE USAGE:                                     
                               Fuzz file paths from wordlist.txt,               
                             match all responses but filter out                 
                             those with content-size 42.                        
                               Colored, verbose output.                         
                                 ffuf -w wordlist.txt -u                        
                             https://example.org/FUZZ -mc all -fs               
                             42 -c -v                                           
                                                                                
                               Fuzz Host-header, match HTTP 200                 
                             responses.                                         
                                 ffuf -w hosts.txt -u                           
                             https://example.org/ -H "Host: FUZZ"               
                             -mc 200                                            
                                                                                
