                             responses reflecting the value of                  
                             "VAL" keyword. Colored.                            
                                 ffuf -w params.txt:PARAM -w                    
                             values.txt:VAL -u                                  
                             https://example.org/?PARAM=VAL -mr                 
                             "VAL" -c                                           
                                                                                
